Package: hdststs
Type: Package
Title: High-Dimensional Smoothed SVM, Quantile, and Huber Regression (Rcpp)
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(person(given = "Yikai", family = "Zhang", role = c("aut","cre"),
                    email = "yikai-zhang@uiowa.edu"))
Description: A unified package combining the hdhuber, hdsvm, and hdqr solvers for
    high-dimensional penalized Huber regression, support vector machines, and
    quantile regression. The coordinate-descent kernels are implemented in C++
    via Rcpp (translated from the original Fortran), using uniform-density
    convolution smoothing.
License: GPL (>= 2)
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 3.6)
LinkingTo: Rcpp
Imports: Rcpp, Matrix, methods
RoxygenNote: 7.3.2.9000
